# Version bumps — only on request

Never bump the addon version, homepage stamp, helper stamp, or release docs unless the user explicitly asks (e.g. "bump to 2.0.0.19", "ship a release", "update version").

**Do not change without an explicit ask:**
- `G::AddonDef.Version.Revision` (and Major/Minor/Build) in `src/entry.cpp`
- `kHomePageVersion` in `src/HomePage.cpp`
- `kHelperStamp` in `src/WikiBrowser.cpp`
- Version strings / “What’s new” sections in `README.md`, `docs/RELEASE_NOTES.md`, `docs/RAIDCORE.md`, `docs/description.html`, `docs/DISCORD*.md`, `docs/CATALOG.md`

**Allowed without a version bump:** bug fixes, features, rebuild/`make install`, and commits — keep the current version numbers unless told otherwise.

When the user does ask to bump/ship, update code stamps, docs, Discord note, rebuild the DLL, and install together.
